  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Native library 1.2.2: the Linux libraries link OpenSSL statically, so they no longer use the system OpenSSL and work in host processes that bring their own, such as Node.js. Includes 1.2.1's fix: start_split and start_merge copy their input. Targets .NET 10. Projects on .NET 8 or 9 can use 1.2.0, which has the 1.2.0 library without this fix: dotnet add package EdiFabric.Native.X12 --version 1.2.0",
